88053106564760", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_1288053109898093_5627647101387157081_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3eOh_EAcJD4Q7kNvwG_ZGPn&_nc_oc=Adq5UqpmtcE8H8QE7hl-T0Yx9AHFH-MMZYtvrtrtr9VH-52mjh-1Yykn4wPEWikSNf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPI0BopGCGrONfqeeO6_2aIsT9tyDDy_fUhUDp22ZmlOQ&oe=6AE1F2FE"}, {"file_name": "___nf 24.png", "id": "1277605120972197", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_1277605124305530_4939252586869181732_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2w-E-UDm-e0Q7kNvwFA3_yO&_nc_oc=AdqEpmRrVaYwk9ceDXTuqj32vy6O59SfL5IpxcmNJnuQ_BTp0-xw0QAFOW-BpXo6c_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPM7vpJpmeFN9YHbBeyrjvh6POhOUezadMz9rwMdnZX1A&oe=6AE21B55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "META_Cover Art Landscape_ 2560 x 1440px_.png", "id": "2594218011052940", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_2594218014386273_6845068353195460025_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-O0fQ2QUA7sQ7kNvwGtkDrI&_nc_oc=AdpvLwSiEOiTyW2VF0JRyzkHRrg1t2N35hnvaQxjmyk9BN4SNOdjUc5OdjffoLDbUwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOTgLRQ-kIqf1kcEfTbQVn6zMCHL7uyT5lDT3EnROeabw&oe=6AE20422"}, "display_name": "WRATH: Aeon of Ruin VR - Brutal Edition", "keywords": ["shooter", "action", "boomershooter", "retro", "quake"], "long_description": "The Old World has rotted. The Guardians are corrupted. The darkness is hungry.\n\n**WRATH: Aeon of Ruin VR - Brutal Edition** is a fast, old-school FPS built for VR. Dual-wield weapons, blade dash through swarms, and slide under danger to keep your momentum. \n\n{26839031932367628}\n\nBrutal Edition is WRATH rebuilt and enhanced by a simple philosophy: deliver a more visceral experience. Expect enhanced dynamic movement, over-the-top combat, ramped-up bullet effects, and a helluva lot of blood. This edition also refines the experience with wide-ranging improvements to combat, audio, effects, and overall polish. It\u2019s the definitive way to play WRATH and you\u2019re going to make a damn big mess doing it!\n\n{876196982105705}\n\n**What you do minute to minute:**\n\n-  Sprint through gothic ruins and cursed wilds, hunting secrets and survival pickups.\n- Keep one hand precise and the other clearing space with raw firepower.\n- Break formations with movement, slide lines, and blade dash escapes.\n- Pull out an artifact, use it physically, and turn the fight in your favor.\n\n{943083994749418}\n**Key Features:**\n\n- Dual-wielding combat built for VR\n- Quick reloads, two-handed weapon handling, and quick access to your arsenal\n- Blade dash movement and high-velocity slide\n- Physical artifact interactions, including throwables and deployable\n- Hand-based UI and an interactive 3D journal for lore, objectives, and options\n- An unsettling soundtrack by composer Andrew Hulshult (Doom Eternal DLC, Amid Evil, Dusk)\n- In-run difficulty options.\n\n\n{1135180692034663}\n", "short_description": "The Old World has rotted. The Guardians are corrupted. The darkness is hungry.\n\nWRATH: Aeon of Ruin VR - Brutal Edition is a fast, brutal old-school FPS built for motion controls. Dual-wield weapons, reload with a quick flick of the wrist, blade dash through swarms, and slide under danger to keep your momentum. "}]}, "developer_name": "Flat2VR Studios, Team Beef", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.flat2vrstudios.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flat2VR Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://flat2vrstudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "extern